---json
{
  "layout": "layouts/believe.njk",
  "permalink": "/new/index.html",
  "seo": { "title": "What's new | Quickler", "description": "Every change to Quickler, newest first: what you can now do, and what we fixed.", "canonical": "https://quickler.co/new/" }
}
---
{#- What's new (Philip 5 Nov 2026, Q16: "and then from every promote over time
    can you back date that"): one entry per release to prod, newest first, in
    plain words. Add an entry to src/_data/whatsnew.json at every promote. -#}
<div class="card">
  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">What's new.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">Every change to Quickler, newest first.</p>
</div>
{%- for e in whatsnew %}
<div class="wf-card wf-expanded" style="margin-bottom:14px">
  <div class="wf-title-row">
    <span class="wf-name-block"><h2 class="wf-name site-h">{{ e.title }}</h2></span>
    <span class="wf-activity">{{ e.dateText }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="wf-body"><ul class="site-words">{% for i in e.items %}<li>{{ i }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
